# React Components

- Use functional components with TypeScript
- Keep business logic out of UI — graph layout in hooks, data in `content/`
- Colocate graph components under `src/components/graph/`
- Use `@/` path alias for imports from `src/`
- Prefer Tailwind utility classes for styling

```tsx
// Good — data passed as props
function TopicNode({ data }: NodeProps<TopicNodeData>) {
  return <div className="rounded-lg border p-3">{data.title}</div>;
}

// Bad — importing curriculum directly in a leaf component
import { topics } from '@/content/curriculum';
```
